          ],
          "content": "**Think it over!**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.271,
            0.468,
            0.74,
            0.591
          ],
          "content": "Suppose you are travelling on a ship which is moving at a constant speed along a straight line on a calm sea. Suppose there is no window on the ship. Is there any way that you can determine whether the ship is moving or is stationary?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
