            0.712,
            0.678,
            0.735
          ],
          "content": " Take an eraser and drop it from a certain height."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.74,
            0.37,
            0.76
          ],
          "content": " Observe its motion."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.766,
            0.745,
            0.891
          ],
          "content": "Does it move along a straight line? When an orange drops from the tree, does it move in a straight line? Have you seen the Republic Day parade? Recall the march-past of students during the parade. Do they move on a straight-line path? When a heavy box is pushed, it may also move along a straight line (Fig. 5.14)."
        },
